/bazel-*
*.ppm
*.png
# EXCEPT the published ones. `*.png` above is for stray captures -- world.ppm,
# triangle.png, whatever --shot was last pointed at -- and it silently swallowed
# `git add docs/hero.png` too, which is the kind of thing that gets diagnosed
# six weeks later as "the README image never worked".
!docs/*.png
# The fox is a checked-in asset, not a capture.
!assets/fox/*.png
# Pixel-checksum goldens live with the test that owns them; they are reviewed
# like code, not ignored like captures.
!tests/**/golden/**
